   "An order code is the base number H11AA1, a hyphen, X and two digits for the package option (00 then the option digit), and a final T for tape and reel. Option 1 adds DIN EN 60747-5-5 (VDE0884-5) approval; option 6 widens the lead spacing from 7.62 mm to 10.16 mm; option 7 is the surface-mount form, its leads standing more than 0.7 mm clear."
  ]
